    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6243291639808
    m_Localized: Your goal is to distrupt the work of all other workers so that they
      get fired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10129633062912
    m_Localized: You can distrupt their work by destroying their workstations, coffee
      makers, printers and other office utensils.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10803817099264
    m_Localized: To destroy an object walk to it USING W,A,S,D buttons and PRESS
      AND HOLD E to interact. You can use SHIFT to sprint. Watch out stamina meter
      over your head, when it's depleated you won't be able to run until it's replenished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11359956643840
    m_Localized: Each of your cooworkers has their likings, and each of the interactable
      items affects different groups. To successfully fire a worker you need to destroy
      every item of the group AND the worker's workstation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11892087992320
    m_Localized: While destroying you can't be spotted. If anyone spots you, you
      will be reported to boss and fired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12079082647552
    m_Localized: Good luck!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12969311088640
    m_Localized: Reduce NPC vision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13030749253632
    m_Localized: Faster destroying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13071358504960
    m_Localized: More stamina
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91660619866112
    m_Localized: You are fired!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109468099534848
    m_Localized: You won!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
